1
00:03:26,560 --> 00:03:28,080
This was your brother's

2
00:03:29,020 --> 00:03:30,080
favorite wine, and mine.

3
00:03:32,520 --> 00:03:34,460
He was very particular about wine

4
00:03:34,580 --> 00:03:36,259
and would only go to one tavern.

5
00:03:49,080 --> 00:03:50,460
I know this is too much for you

6
00:03:51,800 --> 00:03:53,259
to take in at once.

7
00:03:54,599 --> 00:03:56,000
You may even find it hard to believe

8
00:03:57,759 --> 00:03:59,599
he would go that far for you.

9
00:04:02,479 --> 00:04:03,280
Well,

10
00:04:06,620 --> 00:04:08,759
why did you come to Nanhuai?

11
00:04:16,560 --> 00:04:18,120
Your brother and I had an agreement.

12
00:04:20,980 --> 00:04:21,680
I know.

13
00:04:26,379 --> 00:04:28,279
Though you never said it,

14
00:04:30,279 --> 00:04:31,079
you've publicly

15
00:04:31,079 --> 00:04:33,920
managed the Imperial West for me,

16
00:04:35,360 --> 00:04:36,259
while secretly

17
00:04:37,519 --> 00:04:38,759
traveling everywhere

18
00:04:40,720 --> 00:04:42,160
and funding the reading society.

19
00:04:44,480 --> 00:04:45,540
You're smarter

20
00:04:47,399 --> 00:04:48,839
than your brother imagined.

21
00:04:51,220 --> 00:04:51,720
In Japan, he and I

22
00:04:51,720 --> 00:04:53,259
joined a reading society.

23
00:04:54,459 --> 00:04:55,879
We sent all kinds of books

24
00:04:56,100 --> 00:04:57,560
back to China

25
00:04:57,800 --> 00:04:59,100
and helped transport supplies.

26
00:05:00,259 --> 00:05:02,120
But he was born into a warlord family,

27
00:05:02,600 --> 00:05:03,699
so his position was awkward

28
00:05:04,800 --> 00:05:06,360
and people questioned him.

29
00:05:07,160 --> 00:05:08,660
Yet through every doubt,

30
00:05:08,660 --> 00:05:10,660
he stayed firm and never gave up.

31
00:05:12,759 --> 00:05:13,459
Eventually,

32
00:05:14,420 --> 00:05:15,800
the reading society was suppressed.

33
00:05:17,560 --> 00:05:18,839
In our most hopeless hour,

34
00:05:19,899 --> 00:05:21,399
he stepped forward

35
00:05:22,100 --> 00:05:23,639
and led

36
00:05:24,560 --> 00:05:25,720
us through.

37
00:05:29,420 --> 00:05:30,579
Then one day,

38
00:05:32,699 --> 00:05:34,160
he received a letter.

39
00:05:39,680 --> 00:05:40,720
What was in the letter?

40
00:05:44,620 --> 00:05:45,540
My mother writes

41
00:05:46,199 --> 00:05:47,259
that my father is gravely ill.

42
00:05:48,060 --> 00:05:48,879
I'll set out

43
00:05:49,860 --> 00:05:50,720
tomorrow morning.

44
00:05:54,839 --> 00:05:55,920
The reading society

45
00:05:56,579 --> 00:05:58,319
has only just been rebuilt.

46
00:05:58,839 --> 00:06:00,079
Are you really

47
00:06:00,699 --> 00:06:01,939
returning at a time like this?

48
00:06:05,879 --> 00:06:07,139
Nanhuai is my hometown,

49
00:06:08,199 --> 00:06:09,120
and my family is there.

50
00:06:09,680 --> 00:06:11,139
The Yu Army's future

51
00:06:11,500 --> 00:06:12,019
is bound up

52
00:06:12,019 --> 00:06:13,540
with the lives of the people.

53
00:06:14,079 --> 00:06:14,980
The country is in chaos,

54
00:06:14,980 --> 00:06:15,879
and the army cannot be

55
00:06:16,600 --> 00:06:18,720
without a commander for a single day.

56
00:06:19,439 --> 00:06:20,920
I must go back.

57
00:06:21,379 --> 00:06:22,540
But once you return,

58
00:06:23,420 --> 00:06:24,459
your father will certainly

59
00:06:25,160 --> 00:06:26,540
make you take over the Yu Army.

60
00:06:28,019 --> 00:06:28,819
What will you choose?

61
00:06:31,120 --> 00:06:32,240
Whatever I choose,

62
00:06:33,259 --> 00:06:34,000
I will never give up

63
00:06:34,000 --> 00:06:34,779
our ideals.

64
00:06:35,379 --> 00:06:36,319
When you come back,

65
00:06:36,819 --> 00:06:38,139
we'll continue side by side.

66
00:06:39,819 --> 00:06:40,920
My promise to you

67
00:06:42,019 --> 00:06:43,139
will never change.

68
00:06:48,839 --> 00:06:50,000
He had too many people

69
00:06:50,920 --> 00:06:52,579
he wanted to protect

70
00:06:53,680 --> 00:06:55,660
and too many painful choices

71
00:06:56,660 --> 00:06:58,060
to weigh.

72
00:06:59,319 --> 00:07:00,720
He tried to take care of everyone,

73
00:07:02,079 --> 00:07:05,519
yet in the end couldn't do

74
00:07:07,120 --> 00:07:08,720
the thing he wanted most.

75
00:07:13,579 --> 00:07:15,500
He carried a fire in his chest.

76
00:07:17,379 --> 00:07:19,019
It was lit when he studied in Japan

77
00:07:19,779 --> 00:07:21,420
and never went out.

78
00:07:22,319 --> 00:07:22,720
It was not

79
00:07:22,720 --> 00:07:24,579
a fire of ambition for power.

80
00:07:26,660 --> 00:07:28,620
It was a fire against this rotten age,

81
00:07:29,319 --> 00:07:31,120
meant to blaze a path of survival

82
00:07:31,120 --> 00:07:32,420
for this land

83
00:07:34,319 --> 00:07:35,920
and its common people.

84
00:07:40,920 --> 00:07:42,519
He wrote to me,

85
00:07:44,620 --> 00:07:45,420
"Zhongfang,

86
00:07:47,439 --> 00:07:48,160
if you saw how fiercely

87
00:07:48,160 --> 00:07:49,939
Changxuan trains his troops,

88
00:07:51,220 --> 00:07:52,279
you'd understand

89
00:07:53,639 --> 00:07:55,060
why I always say

90
00:07:55,060 --> 00:07:56,740
he was born to lead."

91
00:07:58,579 --> 00:07:59,980
From beginning to end,

92
00:08:01,439 --> 00:08:03,079
he only hoped you would become

93
00:08:04,319 --> 00:08:06,079
stronger than him, lead the Yu Army,

94
00:08:08,079 --> 00:08:09,319
and bring about

95
00:08:10,019 --> 00:08:12,779
the bright, just world he dreamed of.

96
00:08:16,319 --> 00:08:17,420
If he were alive,

97
00:08:19,420 --> 00:08:20,779
he would not want you

98
00:08:21,220 --> 00:08:23,620
to stay broken by guilt.

99
00:08:24,779 --> 00:08:25,680
I believe

100
00:08:27,680 --> 00:08:28,459
he bore the disgrace

101
00:08:28,459 --> 00:08:30,019
of that defeat for you

102
00:08:30,879 --> 00:08:33,879
and gave his life to protect you

103
00:08:34,480 --> 00:08:35,820
because he wanted you

104
00:08:36,639 --> 00:08:37,299
to keep walking for him,

105
00:08:37,299 --> 00:08:39,120
and for all of us

106
00:08:40,019 --> 00:08:41,220
whose fire has not gone out.

107
00:10:32,379 --> 00:10:33,559
Since childhood,

108
00:10:35,240 --> 00:10:35,940
I tried to

109
00:10:35,940 --> 00:10:37,360
outdo him in everything,

110
00:10:39,580 --> 00:10:41,159
to take everything from him.

111
00:10:43,639 --> 00:10:44,799
All I did

112
00:10:46,799 --> 00:10:48,360
was to surpass him.

113
00:10:52,600 --> 00:10:54,080
But now I understand,

114
00:10:56,000 --> 00:10:58,100
the things I desperately chased

115
00:11:01,000 --> 00:11:02,559
never mattered to him.

116
00:11:09,940 --> 00:11:10,740
Tell me,

117
00:11:13,740 --> 00:11:15,299
isn't that ridiculous?

118
00:11:19,740 --> 00:11:20,899
I understand.

119
00:11:24,059 --> 00:11:25,740
You did it

120
00:11:26,919 --> 00:11:29,000
all for their approval,

121
00:11:31,639 --> 00:11:32,840
and you never bore him

122
00:11:32,840 --> 00:11:34,159
any real hatred.

123
00:11:35,620 --> 00:11:36,419
Yes.

124
00:11:40,200 --> 00:11:42,399
I wanted their approval so badly.

125
00:11:45,860 --> 00:11:47,139
Yet in the end,

126
00:11:49,799 --> 00:11:51,440
the person who recognized me most

127
00:11:53,600 --> 00:11:55,039
and believed in me most

128
00:11:58,240 --> 00:11:59,600
was my elder brother.

129
00:12:03,039 --> 00:12:04,440
Zhongfang was right.

130
00:12:06,899 --> 00:12:08,100
He had

131
00:12:09,460 --> 00:12:11,159
too many things to weigh.

132
00:12:13,200 --> 00:12:13,759
If he could have been

133
00:12:13,759 --> 00:12:15,340
just a little selfish,

134
00:12:17,059 --> 00:12:19,299
he wouldn't have had

135
00:12:21,240 --> 00:12:22,840
to return to Nanhuai for Father,

136
00:12:24,740 --> 00:12:26,539
give up his future for the Yu family,

137
00:12:30,440 --> 00:12:31,440
or sacrifice himself

138
00:12:31,440 --> 00:12:33,159
for a useless younger brother

139
00:12:34,139 --> 00:12:35,200
like me.

140
00:12:41,480 --> 00:12:43,100
Now I understand everything.

141
00:12:45,139 --> 00:12:46,559
I want to apologize to him,

142
00:12:50,039 --> 00:12:51,440
but it's too late.

143
00:12:56,139 --> 00:12:57,559
He won't blame you.

144
00:13:00,840 --> 00:13:02,299
Show him he didn't put his faith

145
00:13:04,440 --> 00:13:05,980
in the wrong person.

146
00:13:27,279 --> 00:13:28,820
Cheers.

147
00:13:36,080 --> 00:13:36,740
Have a drink.

148
00:13:37,679 --> 00:13:38,100
Cheers.

149
00:13:38,580 --> 00:13:39,220
Miss Tao,

150
00:13:39,559 --> 00:13:40,200
it's truly an honor

151
00:13:40,200 --> 00:13:41,460
to have you with us today.

152
00:13:41,460 --> 00:13:42,820
Yes.

153
00:13:42,820 --> 00:13:43,940
Join us more often.

154
00:13:43,940 --> 00:13:44,580
Exactly.

155
00:13:44,580 --> 00:13:45,720
We should get together more.

156
00:13:50,019 --> 00:13:51,100
Who is that man?

157
00:13:51,600 --> 00:13:52,820
Why is he staring at you?

158
00:14:03,080 --> 00:14:04,720
You don't know him?

159
00:14:05,320 --> 00:14:09,019
That's a major figure,

160
00:14:09,279 --> 00:14:10,980
the newly appointed Director Jiang

161
00:14:11,299 --> 00:14:12,419
of the Propaganda Department.

162
00:14:13,940 --> 00:14:15,700
What a strange world.

163
00:14:15,799 --> 00:14:16,539
Even a cripple

164
00:14:16,539 --> 00:14:18,220
can make it into propaganda.

165
00:14:20,740 --> 00:14:22,179
That takes extraordinary talent.

166
00:14:22,179 --> 00:14:24,059
That's what makes him impressive.

167
00:14:25,059 --> 00:14:26,539
A cripple

168
00:14:26,779 --> 00:14:28,320
climbing that high.

169
00:14:35,299 --> 00:14:37,000
I'm in a good mood tonight.

170
00:14:37,279 --> 00:14:40,659
I'll cover all the drinks.

171
00:14:40,659 --> 00:14:42,159
Everyone, thank Miss Tao.

172
00:14:42,159 --> 00:14:44,080
Thank you.

173
00:14:44,980 --> 00:14:46,559
- Come, cheers.
- Cheers.

174
00:14:59,840 --> 00:15:00,779
Young lady,

175
00:15:01,139 --> 00:15:02,379
why walk alone at night?

176
00:15:02,379 --> 00:15:03,440
Aren't you afraid of trouble?

177
00:15:04,840 --> 00:15:07,379
Why don't we two act as your escorts

178
00:15:07,379 --> 00:15:08,100
and take you home?

179
00:15:08,100 --> 00:15:08,899
Get lost.

180
00:15:13,340 --> 00:15:14,779
Feisty, aren't you?

181
00:15:15,440 --> 00:15:16,240
Lucky for us,

182
00:15:16,379 --> 00:15:16,919
we like

183
00:15:17,039 --> 00:15:18,860
feisty women.

184
00:15:19,139 --> 00:15:21,039
I said get lost. Are you deaf?

185
00:15:21,039 --> 00:15:21,539
You...

186
00:15:23,039 --> 00:15:24,039
You dare hit me?

187
00:15:24,299 --> 00:15:25,539
Don't think I won't hit a woman.

188
00:15:35,159 --> 00:15:35,480
You...

189
00:15:36,799 --> 00:15:37,120
Let...

190
00:15:38,159 --> 00:15:38,480
Let go...

191
00:15:40,139 --> 00:15:40,899
Where did you come from,

192
00:15:40,899 --> 00:15:41,820
you damn cripple?

193
00:15:41,899 --> 00:15:42,879
Meddle in my affairs?

194
00:15:42,940 --> 00:15:43,519
Get him.

195
00:16:00,600 --> 00:16:01,399
Get lost.

196
00:16:01,840 --> 00:16:03,440
You damn cripple,

197
00:16:03,440 --> 00:16:03,879
you'll pay.

198
00:16:03,879 --> 00:16:04,799
You'll regret this.

199
00:16:13,039 --> 00:16:13,879
You've drunk too much.

200
00:16:15,779 --> 00:16:16,879
Let me take you home.

201
00:16:18,700 --> 00:16:20,179
Who do you think you are?

202
00:16:21,039 --> 00:16:22,580
It's none of your business.

203
00:16:25,159 --> 00:16:25,519
Let go.

204
00:16:25,519 --> 00:16:26,019
Stop fighting it.

205
00:16:26,600 --> 00:16:26,899
Let me go.

206
00:16:26,899 --> 00:16:27,940
Stop it.

207
00:16:29,340 --> 00:16:29,720
You...

208
00:16:33,759 --> 00:16:34,240
are....

209
00:16:35,940 --> 00:16:36,840
are you hurt?

210
00:16:41,639 --> 00:16:42,679
My car is right over there.

211
00:16:47,000 --> 00:16:47,799
All right.

212
00:16:48,879 --> 00:16:50,799
Since you saved me today,

213
00:16:51,840 --> 00:16:53,139
I'll allow you to escort me home.

214
00:18:31,880 --> 00:18:32,740
You're back?

215
00:18:36,940 --> 00:18:37,740
Yes.

216
00:19:25,859 --> 00:19:26,500
Father.

217
00:19:28,579 --> 00:19:29,640
Good.

218
00:19:32,880 --> 00:19:34,579
There are many

219
00:19:34,579 --> 00:19:35,940
military matters waiting for you.

220
00:20:04,140 --> 00:20:05,180
All troops.

221
00:20:06,220 --> 00:20:08,099
Greetings, General Yu.

222
00:20:09,140 --> 00:20:09,940
The border of Nanhuai

223
00:20:10,700 --> 00:20:12,440
has been quiet lately,

224
00:20:12,880 --> 00:20:14,039
with no beacon fires lit.

225
00:20:14,700 --> 00:20:16,259
But as soldiers,

226
00:20:16,720 --> 00:20:18,160
we must always

227
00:20:18,619 --> 00:20:20,680
remain ready and alert.

228
00:20:21,160 --> 00:20:22,420
One more drop of sweat

229
00:20:22,960 --> 00:20:24,119
on the training ground,

230
00:20:24,819 --> 00:20:26,019
one more layer of hardship endured,

231
00:20:26,819 --> 00:20:27,740
means

232
00:20:28,559 --> 00:20:30,160
one less drop of blood on the battlefield

233
00:20:30,920 --> 00:20:32,160
and one more chance of victory.

234
00:20:32,579 --> 00:20:33,619
Do you understand?

235
00:20:33,720 --> 00:20:34,519
Yes.

236
00:20:48,200 --> 00:20:49,000
Changxuan,

237
00:20:50,140 --> 00:20:51,000
a telegram has arrived.

238
00:20:51,500 --> 00:20:52,599
The Guangzhou National Government

239
00:20:52,599 --> 00:20:53,740
has pacified all of Guangdong,

240
00:20:53,740 --> 00:20:54,779
and Guangxi has pledged allegiance.

241
00:20:55,180 --> 00:20:56,740
The Southern Revolutionary Army is formed

242
00:20:56,740 --> 00:20:58,279
and has sent 100,000 troops into Hunan.

243
00:20:59,279 --> 00:21:00,680
Fighting has begun in Changsha.

244
00:21:01,559 --> 00:21:02,200
Commander Qu

245
00:21:02,200 --> 00:21:03,299
telephoned headquarters.

246
00:21:03,359 --> 00:21:03,900
He says the central government

247
00:21:03,900 --> 00:21:05,160
has approved a proposal

248
00:21:05,319 --> 00:21:06,460
for us to join forces and

249
00:21:06,759 --> 00:21:08,000
resist the revolutionary army together.

250
00:21:11,660 --> 00:21:13,019
Reply now.

251
00:21:14,160 --> 00:21:16,019
Local bandit activity has been rampant.

252
00:21:16,759 --> 00:21:18,160
If we pull troops north,

253
00:21:19,000 --> 00:21:20,200
the region may fall out of control

254
00:21:20,759 --> 00:21:21,819
and burden the central government.

255
00:21:22,319 --> 00:21:23,599
Then you mean...

256
00:21:24,900 --> 00:21:25,420
At this stage,

257
00:21:25,420 --> 00:21:27,160
our core strategy

258
00:21:28,099 --> 00:21:29,400
is to improve weapons

259
00:21:30,160 --> 00:21:31,660
and increase artillery production.

260
00:21:33,200 --> 00:21:35,259
Our task is to protect the region,

261
00:21:36,660 --> 00:21:38,200
not to be dragged into civil war.

262
00:21:52,960 --> 00:21:54,599
Most Chinese

263
00:21:54,599 --> 00:21:55,839
troops use

264
00:21:55,839 --> 00:21:56,819
either

265
00:21:56,819 --> 00:21:59,339
the German Mauser 1898

266
00:21:59,339 --> 00:22:00,079
or

267
00:22:00,079 --> 00:22:02,480
the Belgian FN M1924,

268
00:22:03,319 --> 00:22:04,480
both with five-round magazines.

269
00:22:05,099 --> 00:22:07,259
These semi-automatic rifles, however,

270
00:22:07,480 --> 00:22:10,259
have a twenty-round capacity.

271
00:22:11,519 --> 00:22:11,859
When can

272
00:22:11,859 --> 00:22:12,839
mass production begin?

273
00:22:13,740 --> 00:22:15,859
We need a few more days for adjustments.

274
00:22:15,960 --> 00:22:17,000
If nothing goes wrong,

275
00:22:17,099 --> 00:22:17,940
the arsenal will soon

276
00:22:17,940 --> 00:22:19,900
be able to produce them in quantity.

277
00:22:21,119 --> 00:22:21,559
Good.

278
00:22:31,579 --> 00:22:32,559
One more thing,

279
00:22:32,759 --> 00:22:33,519
when using

280
00:22:33,519 --> 00:22:34,960
these rifles, be careful

281
00:22:35,059 --> 00:22:35,559
What's wrong?

282
00:22:35,720 --> 00:22:36,160
with the trigger.

283
00:22:36,500 --> 00:22:37,579
Safety first.

284
00:23:03,339 --> 00:23:04,180
Young Madam,

285
00:23:05,119 --> 00:23:06,259
you have a telephone call.

286
00:23:07,299 --> 00:23:08,000
Coming.

287
00:23:13,059 --> 00:23:14,539
Walking is good for you.

288
00:23:15,079 --> 00:23:16,720
It gets the blood moving

289
00:23:17,400 --> 00:23:20,440
and will make labor easier.

290
00:23:21,559 --> 00:23:23,559
It's so much trouble for you

291
00:23:23,559 --> 00:23:24,859
to keep me company every day.

292
00:23:25,759 --> 00:23:27,200
Nonsense.

293
00:23:27,640 --> 00:23:29,380
We're all looking forward to the baby.

294
00:23:29,700 --> 00:23:30,740
The house

295
00:23:30,940 --> 00:23:32,279
will be so lively when it comes.

296
00:23:33,859 --> 00:23:34,559
Madam!

297
00:23:35,500 --> 00:23:36,119
Madam!

298
00:23:36,200 --> 00:23:37,599
What is it? Why are you so flustered?

299
00:23:37,599 --> 00:23:38,859
Something terrible has happened.

300
00:23:39,240 --> 00:23:41,359
The Changpingshan Arsenal exploded.

301
00:23:41,359 --> 00:23:42,839
The whole place has collapsed.

302
00:23:42,839 --> 00:23:43,759
Where is Changxuan?

303
00:23:44,000 --> 00:23:45,900
He's buried inside too.

304
00:23:45,900 --> 00:23:46,539
What?

305
00:23:49,019 --> 00:23:49,759
- Madam!
- Mother!

306
00:23:49,759 --> 00:23:50,259
Mother!

307
00:23:53,259 --> 00:23:54,039
Miss!

308
00:23:54,039 --> 00:23:54,700
Doctor!

309
00:23:54,700 --> 00:23:54,960
Miss!

310
00:23:54,960 --> 00:23:55,559
Call a doctor!

311
00:23:55,559 --> 00:23:56,240
I'll get a car.

312
00:23:56,359 --> 00:23:57,079
I'll get a car.

313
00:24:02,099 --> 00:24:03,200
Somebody help!

314
00:24:04,539 --> 00:24:05,539
Clear the road!

315
00:24:21,019 --> 00:24:22,799
Come on, keep up.

316
00:24:26,640 --> 00:24:27,279
Yu Changxuan!

317
00:24:28,619 --> 00:24:29,240
Yu Changxuan!

318
00:24:30,099 --> 00:24:30,480
Pingjun,

319
00:24:30,759 --> 00:24:31,400
it's dangerous here.

320
00:24:31,400 --> 00:24:32,000
You can't go in.

321
00:24:32,000 --> 00:24:32,839
Please calm down.

322
00:24:32,900 --> 00:24:34,279
Tell me where Changxuan is.

323
00:24:41,759 --> 00:24:42,359
Don't!

324
00:24:47,420 --> 00:24:47,980
Changxuan!

325
00:24:49,119 --> 00:24:50,000
Changxuan!

326
00:24:51,680 --> 00:24:53,460
Don't frighten me like this.

327
00:24:53,740 --> 00:24:54,539
Changxuan!

328
00:24:55,819 --> 00:24:58,079
Can you hear me?

329
00:24:58,079 --> 00:24:59,740
You're going to be fine.

330
00:25:02,079 --> 00:25:04,380
You have to be, all right?

331
00:25:05,160 --> 00:25:06,160
Changxuan!

332
00:25:08,039 --> 00:25:08,519
Changxuan,

333
00:25:08,519 --> 00:25:10,019
can you hear me?

334
00:25:10,019 --> 00:25:10,960
Changxuan!

335
00:25:16,859 --> 00:25:17,940
Changxuan!

336
00:25:22,519 --> 00:25:23,319
Changxuan...

337
00:25:25,720 --> 00:25:27,359
If you're safe,

338
00:25:29,319 --> 00:25:32,019
I'll agree to anything.

339
00:25:36,019 --> 00:25:37,240
Let's stay together

340
00:25:38,359 --> 00:25:40,380
all our lives, please.

341
00:25:47,119 --> 00:25:48,059
You can never

342
00:25:49,660 --> 00:25:51,000
take those words back.

343
00:25:55,980 --> 00:25:56,700
Changxuan?

344
00:25:57,380 --> 00:25:58,180
Changxuan?

345
00:27:30,359 --> 00:27:31,640
You're alive!

346
00:27:34,599 --> 00:27:35,559
How could I bear to die

347
00:27:37,220 --> 00:27:38,380
without seeing you?

348
00:27:39,859 --> 00:27:40,900
At a time like this,

349
00:27:40,900 --> 00:27:42,160
you're still joking.

350
00:27:46,859 --> 00:27:48,000
I heard

351
00:27:49,140 --> 00:27:50,579
every word you said.

352
00:27:52,700 --> 00:27:53,539
Did you mean it?

353
00:28:00,619 --> 00:28:01,680
Changxuan,

354
00:28:04,599 --> 00:28:05,599
when I thought

355
00:28:05,599 --> 00:28:07,240
I'd never see you again,

356
00:28:10,339 --> 00:28:11,539
I realized

357
00:28:12,680 --> 00:28:13,680
the past

358
00:28:13,680 --> 00:28:14,839
doesn't matter.

359
00:28:16,640 --> 00:28:17,779
Whether I recover

360
00:28:17,779 --> 00:28:18,740
my memories

361
00:28:18,740 --> 00:28:19,880
doesn't matter either.

362
00:28:21,539 --> 00:28:22,119
What matters

363
00:28:22,119 --> 00:28:23,940
is being together,

364
00:28:25,599 --> 00:28:26,240
our present

365
00:28:26,240 --> 00:28:28,480
and future.

366
00:28:31,000 --> 00:28:32,839
Let's never be separated again.

367
00:28:55,380 --> 00:28:56,099
Pingjun,

368
00:28:58,799 --> 00:28:59,779
I thought

369
00:29:02,680 --> 00:29:03,799
I'd never live

370
00:29:03,799 --> 00:29:04,779
to hear you say that.

371
00:29:11,500 --> 00:29:13,599
No matter what comes,

372
00:29:16,339 --> 00:29:17,880
I'll stay with you.

373
00:29:40,980 --> 00:29:43,039
Candied haws.

374
00:29:56,759 --> 00:29:57,339
There, there.

375
00:29:57,339 --> 00:29:58,519
Would you like another cushion?

376
00:30:03,180 --> 00:30:04,140
Look, his little nose

377
00:30:04,140 --> 00:30:05,140
keeps twitching.

378
00:30:05,140 --> 00:30:06,000
It's so sweet.

379
00:30:07,299 --> 00:30:08,000
Yes.

380
00:30:08,000 --> 00:30:08,900
His eyes and brows

381
00:30:09,140 --> 00:30:10,180
look just like Bingwen's,

382
00:30:10,180 --> 00:30:10,940
as if

383
00:30:10,940 --> 00:30:11,880
from one mold.

384
00:30:17,839 --> 00:30:19,599
He's only just opened his eyes.

385
00:30:19,779 --> 00:30:20,940
I think it would be lovely

386
00:30:21,380 --> 00:30:23,359
if he grew as pretty as Jinxuan.

387
00:30:24,200 --> 00:30:25,000
Right.

388
00:30:25,500 --> 00:30:27,799
She has been pretty since childhood.

389
00:30:28,759 --> 00:30:29,440
Bingwen,

390
00:30:29,680 --> 00:30:31,640
have you thought of a name?

391
00:30:31,880 --> 00:30:33,039
I don't know about names.

392
00:30:34,059 --> 00:30:34,960
Let her decide.

393
00:30:36,579 --> 00:30:37,279
Father,

394
00:30:37,599 --> 00:30:39,299
would you name the child?

395
00:30:42,359 --> 00:30:42,940
Yes.

396
00:30:43,319 --> 00:30:44,640
This is the family's first grandchild.

397
00:30:44,700 --> 00:30:46,599
You should choose his name.

398
00:30:47,200 --> 00:30:47,859
All right.

399
00:30:48,000 --> 00:30:49,099
Your father

400
00:30:49,339 --> 00:30:51,140
thought of it days ago

401
00:30:51,140 --> 00:30:52,779
and wouldn't even show me.

402
00:30:53,279 --> 00:30:54,599
Bring it out.

403
00:30:55,440 --> 00:30:56,400
You caught me.

404
00:30:56,799 --> 00:30:59,000
I meant to save it for last.

405
00:31:01,700 --> 00:31:03,099
I chose three names.

406
00:31:03,160 --> 00:31:03,579
Let me see,

407
00:31:04,339 --> 00:31:05,079
Father.

408
00:31:06,799 --> 00:31:10,000
Zetai, Ze'an, Ze'ning.

409
00:31:11,099 --> 00:31:11,759
Jinxuan,

410
00:31:12,000 --> 00:31:12,799
you choose

411
00:31:12,799 --> 00:31:13,859
whichever you like.

412
00:31:18,599 --> 00:31:19,880
[That child belongs to the Yu family]

413
00:31:21,000 --> 00:31:21,960
[and bears the Yu name.]

414
00:31:23,180 --> 00:31:24,579
[What does he have to do with you?]

415
00:31:31,339 --> 00:31:32,240
Ze'ning,

416
00:31:33,299 --> 00:31:34,599
Yu Zening.

417
00:31:35,480 --> 00:31:36,880
Deep blessings,

418
00:31:37,099 --> 00:31:38,740
peace and gentleness.

419
00:31:40,500 --> 00:31:41,440
This is a good one.

420
00:31:42,140 --> 00:31:42,680
All right, then.

421
00:31:43,680 --> 00:31:46,339
Yu Ze'ning it is.

422
00:31:47,000 --> 00:31:47,299
Good.

423
00:31:47,299 --> 00:31:48,500
Yu Ze'ning.

424
00:31:49,380 --> 00:31:50,200
Ze'ning.

425
00:31:51,700 --> 00:31:52,500
Pingjun,

426
00:31:52,799 --> 00:31:53,660
hold him

427
00:31:53,779 --> 00:31:55,380
and share her blessing.

428
00:32:19,500 --> 00:32:21,779
Look how much

429
00:32:21,900 --> 00:32:23,180
she loves children.

430
00:32:23,579 --> 00:32:24,380
Changxuan,

431
00:32:24,779 --> 00:32:26,119
you'd better hurry.

432
00:32:28,240 --> 00:32:29,000
Yes.

433
00:32:29,380 --> 00:32:30,940
When will our family

434
00:32:30,980 --> 00:32:32,220
have another happy event?

435
00:32:37,299 --> 00:32:38,680
Stop teasing us.

436
00:32:39,279 --> 00:32:41,019
We haven't even finished

437
00:32:41,019 --> 00:32:42,039
celebrating this one.

438
00:32:43,700 --> 00:32:44,519
Isn't that right, Ze'ning?

439
00:32:54,519 --> 00:32:55,539
I never thought

440
00:32:56,380 --> 00:32:57,839
Yu Changxuan would be so hard to kill.

441
00:32:58,779 --> 00:33:00,000
Even with the workshop collapsed,

442
00:33:00,279 --> 00:33:01,559
he still made it out.

443
00:33:02,420 --> 00:33:03,839
That German engineer

444
00:33:03,839 --> 00:33:04,839
was reckless and greedy for credit.

445
00:33:05,599 --> 00:33:06,640
He used a propellant

446
00:33:06,640 --> 00:33:08,240
that had not passed final testing

447
00:33:08,240 --> 00:33:09,240
without authorization.

448
00:33:09,960 --> 00:33:10,900
But the explosion

449
00:33:12,339 --> 00:33:13,420
only made him

450
00:33:13,420 --> 00:33:15,079
tighten supervision and inspection.

451
00:33:16,000 --> 00:33:16,880
He hasn't

452
00:33:17,960 --> 00:33:19,299
slowed at all.

453
00:33:23,079 --> 00:33:24,700
What's his view of the revolutionary army?

454
00:33:28,000 --> 00:33:30,039
Judging by the policies he has issued,

455
00:33:31,039 --> 00:33:32,339
he does not want civil war.

456
00:33:33,339 --> 00:33:34,619
He means to turn away

457
00:33:34,619 --> 00:33:35,640
from the central government.

458
00:33:38,779 --> 00:33:41,180
They'll never let him keep a private army.

459
00:33:43,839 --> 00:33:44,880
I have strengthened my ties

460
00:33:44,880 --> 00:33:45,940
with Chu Wenfu,

461
00:33:46,680 --> 00:33:47,740
and now we are waiting

462
00:33:47,740 --> 00:33:49,039
for the right opportunity.

463
00:33:52,400 --> 00:33:53,579
An opportunity

464
00:33:55,500 --> 00:33:56,819
to join forces

465
00:33:56,819 --> 00:33:58,079
against Yu Changxuan.

466
00:33:59,180 --> 00:34:00,140
When this is done,

467
00:34:01,900 --> 00:34:03,099
the Yu Army's elite,

468
00:34:04,299 --> 00:34:05,579
Nanhuai's wealth,

469
00:34:06,700 --> 00:34:07,779
and the heads of the Yu Changxuan

470
00:34:07,779 --> 00:34:08,800
and his father...

471
00:34:09,840 --> 00:34:10,880
we will each take what we want.

472
00:34:20,139 --> 00:34:22,039
The situation is delicate,

473
00:34:22,340 --> 00:34:23,739
yet the central government insists on

474
00:34:23,880 --> 00:34:25,039
inviting you to a military-political

475
00:34:25,039 --> 00:34:26,179
coordination meeting now.

476
00:34:28,119 --> 00:34:28,920
Isn't it plainly a test

477
00:34:28,920 --> 00:34:29,599
of your attitude toward

478
00:34:29,599 --> 00:34:30,920
the revolutionary army?

479
00:34:32,239 --> 00:34:33,239
Wire the central government back.

480
00:34:33,579 --> 00:34:34,579
Say our forces are mopping up

481
00:34:34,800 --> 00:34:36,380
remaining bandits in the Western Hills.

482
00:34:36,619 --> 00:34:37,719
Have Chief of Staff Gu attend

483
00:34:37,780 --> 00:34:39,179
with two staff officers

484
00:34:39,980 --> 00:34:41,139
and bring our bandit-suppression records

485
00:34:41,139 --> 00:34:42,139
from the past three years.

486
00:34:45,440 --> 00:34:46,380
What if they insist

487
00:34:46,380 --> 00:34:47,219
you state your position?

488
00:34:49,039 --> 00:34:50,420
Then have Chief of Staff Gu

489
00:34:50,639 --> 00:34:52,960
go through the quartermaster accounts.

490
00:34:53,440 --> 00:34:55,500
Say the Yu Army is short of funds,

491
00:34:55,559 --> 00:34:56,539
equipment needs repair,

492
00:34:56,739 --> 00:34:57,780
the bandit campaigns drain our strength,

493
00:34:58,280 --> 00:35:00,059
and we urgently need reinforcements.

494
00:35:01,440 --> 00:35:02,820
If they truly want my position,

495
00:35:03,480 --> 00:35:04,420
they can first solve

496
00:35:04,420 --> 00:35:05,780
these urgent problems.

497
00:35:25,579 --> 00:35:26,440
Young Mistress!

498
00:35:27,179 --> 00:35:28,039
Young Mistress!

499
00:35:30,320 --> 00:35:30,980
Well,

500
00:35:31,239 --> 00:35:32,179
The young master specifically ordered me

501
00:35:32,179 --> 00:35:33,119
to come fetch you.

502
00:35:33,119 --> 00:35:33,920
Fetch me?

503
00:35:34,619 --> 00:35:35,440
Where to?

504
00:35:35,739 --> 00:35:36,579
He did not say.

505
00:35:36,579 --> 00:35:37,860
He only asked that you come at once.

506
00:35:38,039 --> 00:35:39,639
The car is waiting outside.

507
00:36:03,440 --> 00:36:04,239
Changxuan?

508
00:36:07,219 --> 00:36:07,960
Changxuan?

509
00:36:18,579 --> 00:36:20,059
All right, stop it.

510
00:36:20,780 --> 00:36:21,559
Come with me.

511
00:36:22,480 --> 00:36:23,280
Where are we going?

512
00:36:23,619 --> 00:36:24,820
You'll know soon.

513
00:37:47,940 --> 00:37:48,739
Pingjun,

514
00:37:49,639 --> 00:37:51,380
do you know what I thought

515
00:37:51,639 --> 00:37:53,019
when I was buried in the ruins

516
00:37:54,079 --> 00:37:55,380
after the explosion?

517
00:37:57,219 --> 00:37:58,019
I wondered if,

518
00:37:59,739 --> 00:38:01,239
if I died,

519
00:38:02,380 --> 00:38:03,820
you would turn around

520
00:38:03,820 --> 00:38:05,019
and marry another man.

521
00:38:08,579 --> 00:38:09,440
Of course.

522
00:38:10,420 --> 00:38:11,800
I would immediately find myself

523
00:38:11,860 --> 00:38:12,980
another good husband.

524
00:38:21,639 --> 00:38:22,579
Then I cannot

525
00:38:22,579 --> 00:38:23,480
give you the chance.

526
00:38:24,880 --> 00:38:26,480
I'll keep you bound to me.

527
00:38:33,219 --> 00:38:34,019
Listen,

528
00:38:37,119 --> 00:38:38,639
you were unconscious last time,

529
00:38:40,119 --> 00:38:41,119
so today

530
00:38:43,739 --> 00:38:45,380
I want to propose once more.

531
00:38:55,280 --> 00:38:56,119
Ye Pingjun,

532
00:38:57,780 --> 00:38:59,039
will you marry me?

533
00:39:07,539 --> 00:39:08,619
When I woke

534
00:39:08,619 --> 00:39:10,099
from the coma,

535
00:39:11,679 --> 00:39:13,059
everything felt

536
00:39:13,719 --> 00:39:17,280
strange and unclear.

537
00:39:18,840 --> 00:39:20,380
You encouraged me,

538
00:39:21,300 --> 00:39:22,940
taught me to walk again,

539
00:39:23,820 --> 00:39:24,780
and stayed with me

540
00:39:26,900 --> 00:39:28,780
day and night, never leaving.

541
00:39:31,719 --> 00:39:33,639
When I was falsely accused,.

542
00:39:35,380 --> 00:39:36,440
you believed me

543
00:39:36,440 --> 00:39:37,579
without hesitation.

544
00:39:40,079 --> 00:39:41,940
When I was in danger,

545
00:39:43,320 --> 00:39:44,539
you came to protect me

546
00:39:44,539 --> 00:39:45,659
without a second thought.

547
00:39:46,380 --> 00:39:47,820
I wondered

548
00:39:49,980 --> 00:39:51,820
whether my feelings for you

549
00:39:52,960 --> 00:39:54,639
were only gratitude.

550
00:39:56,400 --> 00:39:58,460
After everything we have been through,

551
00:39:59,719 --> 00:40:01,420
I finally know.

552
00:40:06,500 --> 00:40:07,380
Yu Changxuan,

553
00:40:14,239 --> 00:40:16,340
I want to spend my life with you

554
00:40:23,980 --> 00:40:25,500
Then be sure.

555
00:40:26,400 --> 00:40:27,579
Once you agree,

556
00:40:29,340 --> 00:40:30,500
I will

557
00:40:32,280 --> 00:40:33,760
never let go.

558
00:40:36,539 --> 00:40:38,139
You be sure too.

559
00:40:39,139 --> 00:40:40,639
Once I agree,

560
00:40:42,239 --> 00:40:43,920
you can

561
00:40:43,920 --> 00:40:45,039
have only me.

562
00:40:46,099 --> 00:40:48,000
You'll have to give up the whole garden.

563
00:40:53,579 --> 00:40:54,440
My heart

564
00:40:55,840 --> 00:40:56,940
has only

565
00:40:58,019 --> 00:40:59,440
ever held you.

566
00:41:07,719 --> 00:41:08,739
Let this ring be my witness.

567
00:41:09,780 --> 00:41:10,840
For the rest of my life,

568
00:41:13,340 --> 00:41:14,679
I will cherish every day and night,

569
00:41:15,440 --> 00:41:17,239
every month and year with you.

570
00:41:27,039 --> 00:41:28,199
Let this ring be my witness.

571
00:41:29,179 --> 00:41:30,380
For the rest of my life,

572
00:41:31,119 --> 00:41:32,380
I will love you truly,

573
00:41:33,739 --> 00:41:34,920
never leave or forsake you,

574
00:41:38,280 --> 00:41:39,519
and grow old by your side.

575
00:46:04,679 --> 00:46:05,320
Good morning,

576
00:46:06,659 --> 00:46:07,119
my wife.

577
00:46:37,599 --> 00:46:38,519
I'll wait for you at home.

578
00:46:40,460 --> 00:46:41,599
I'll be back early.
